<title>ITALY: SOCCER-ITALIAN FIRST DIVISION SCORERS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ITALIAN FIRST DIVISION SCORERS.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1996-10-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading scorers in Italian first</p>
<p>division after matches on Sunday:</p>
<p>5 - George Weah (Milan), Felippo Inzaghi (Atalanta), Marcello</p>
<p>Otero (Vicenza)</p>
<p>4 - Abel Balbo (Roma)</p>
<p>3 - Pasquale Luiso (Piacenza), Marco Simone (Milan), Sandro</p>
<p>Tovalieri (Reggiana), Enrico Chiesa (Parma), Oliver Bierhoff</p>
<p>(Udinese)</p>
<p>2 - Roberto Baggio (Milan), Gabriel Batistuta and Luis Oliveira</p>
<p>(both Fiorentina), Giovanni Bia (Udinese), Nicola Caccia</p>
<p>(Napoli), Dino Baggio and Gianfranco Zola (both Parma), Daniel</p>
<p>Fonseca (Roma), Igor Kolyvanov, Carlo Nervo and Davide Fontolan</p>
<p>(all Bologna), Roberto Mancini and Vincenzo Montella (both</p>
<p>Sampdoria), Marco Negri (Perugia), Michele Padovano and Ciro</p>
<p>Ferrara (Juventus), Youri Djorkaeff (Inter) Antonio De Vitis</p>
<p>(Verona), Massimo Beghetto (Vicenza)</p>
